Source: ageless-keyring
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ageless Linux <archive@agelesslinux.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), gpg
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://agelesslinux.org
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/agelesslinux/agelesslinux.git
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/agelesslinux/agelesslinux

Package: ageless-keyring
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Ageless Linux archive keyring and apt source
 The OpenPGP key that signs the Ageless Linux package archive, and the apt
 source (/etc/apt/sources.list.d/ageless.sources) that uses it. With this
 installed, "apt update && apt full-upgrade" brings an installed system to
 the latest Ageless Linux packages.
